msgstr "C11, POSIX.1-2008."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron
#: opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "HISTORY"
msgstr "HISTORIAL"

#.  POSIX.1 (1996 edition) requires only the
#.  .BR abs ()
#.  function.
#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron
#: opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "POSIX.1-2001, SVr4, 4.3BSD."
msgid "POSIX.1-2001, C99, SVr4, 4.3BSD."
msgstr "POSIX.1-2001, SVr4, 4.3BSD."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron
#: opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "SVID 3, POSIX.1, BSD 4.3, ISO/IEC 9899 (C99).  POSIX.1 (1996 edition) "
#| "only requires the B<abs()> function.  ISO/IEC 9899:1990 (C89) only "
#| "includes the B<abs()> and B<labs()> functions; the functions B<llabs()> "
#| "and B<imaxabs()> were added in C99."
msgid ""
"C89 only includes the B<abs>()  and B<labs>()  functions; the functions "
"B<llabs>()  and B<imaxabs>()  were added in C99."
msgstr ""
"SVID 3, POSIX.1, BSD 4.3, ISO/IEC 9899 (C99). POSIX.1 (edición de 1996) sólo "
"requiere la función B<abs()>. ISO/IEC 9899:1990 (C89) sólo incluye las "
"funciones B<abs()> y B<labs()>; las funciones B<llabs()> y B<imaxabs()> "
"fueron añadidas en C99."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "NOTES"
msgstr "NOTAS"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Trying to take the absolute value of the most negative integer is not "
"defined."
msgstr ""
"Intentar tomar el valor absoluto del entero más negativo no está definido."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The B<llabs()> function is included in glibc since version 2.0, but is "
#| "not in libc5 or libc4.  The B<imaxabs()> function is included in glibc "
#| "since version 2.1.1."
msgid ""
"The B<llabs>()  function is included since glibc 2.0.  The B<imaxabs>()  "
"function is included since glibc 2.1.1."
msgstr ""
"La función B<llabs()> está incluida en glibc desde la versión 2.0, pero no "
"se encuentra en libc5 ni libc4. La función B<imaxabs()> está incluida en "
"glibc desde la versión 2.1.1."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"For B<llabs>()  to be declared, it may be necessary to define "
"B<_ISOC99_SOURCE> or B<_ISOC9X_SOURCE> (depending on the version of glibc) "
"before including any standard headers."
msgstr ""
"Para que la función B<llabs>() sea declarada, puede ser necesario definir "
"B<_ISOC99_SOURCE> o B<_ISOC9X_SOURCE> (dependiendo de la versión de glibc) "
"antes de incluir cualquiera de las cabeceras estándar."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "GCC handles B<abs()> and B<labs()> as builtin functions.  GCC 3.0 also "
#| "handles B<llabs()> and B<imaxabs()> as builtins."
msgid ""
"By default, GCC handles B<abs>(), B<labs>(), and (since GCC 3.0)  "
"B<llabs>()  and B<imaxabs>()  as built-in functions."
msgstr ""
"GCC maneja B<abs()> y B<labs()> como funciones internas. GCC 3.0 también "
"maneja B<llabs()> y B<imaxabs()> como internas."

